              "value": 8
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your familiar can subsume its body to become pure spirit. Your familiar gains the Shed Spirit activity.\n\n**Shed Spirit**\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Traits:** spirit\n- **Frequency:** once per minute\n\nYour familiar's spirit exits its body, leaving its empty shell behind, before flying at an enemy within 20 feet and dealing 6d6 spirit damage, with a basic Will save against your spell DC. If the familiar dealt damage, it then flies to an ally within 30 feet of the enemy, restoring Hit Points equal to half the damage dealt. Your familiar then re-forms in its original square."
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "levelled_description",
